OL,3,GNEWSACity voluntary groups to share
OL,4,A#400k award
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunity and voluntary organisations
OL,7,Facross a city have been awarded a share
OL,8,Fof #400,000 from the government Pride
OL,9,Fin Place Impact fund.
OL,11,FNewcastle City Council said the cash
OL,12,Fwould make a visible difference to
OL,13,Fneighbourhoods, bring communities
OL,14,Ftogether, and create places residents
OL,15,Fcan feel proud of.
OL,17,FGrants of between #10,700 and #30,000
OL,18,Fhave now been made to 20 groups,
OL,19,Franging from community centres and
OL,20,Fyouth projects to health and wellbeing
OL,21,Fservices and sports group.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
